#: includes/class-admin.php:451
msgid "Questions by topic"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:453
msgid "Where can I find layout patterns and GlotPress data blocks?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:453
msgid ""
"Edit a GlotFrame layout and open the block inserter. Patterns appear under "
"GlotFrame layouts; the five data blocks appear under GlotFrame. For context-"
"dependent previews, choose a project in the block settings. Existing layouts "
"are never replaced automatically."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:454
msgid "Do I need a specific theme or page builder?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:454
msgid ""
"No. GlotFrame supplies its own surrounding layout and uses WordPress "
"presentation blocks. It does not import your active theme’s header or "
"builder templates."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:455
msgid "Why is my layout missing from the selector?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:455
msgid ""
"Only published GlotFrame layouts without password protection can be "
"selected. Drafts and private layouts are never shown to visitors."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:456
msgid "Which blocks can I use?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:456
msgid ""
"Groups, columns, text, headings, images, lists, buttons, spacing, site "
"identity, navigation, social links and details, plus GlotPress project, "
"action and progress blocks. Query, post-content, HTML, shortcode and "
"reusable-content blocks are excluded."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:457
msgid "Does it change translation data or exports?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:457
msgid ""
"No. GlotFrame changes the surrounding HTML layout. Translation permissions, "
"forms, downloads and API responses remain GlotPress’s responsibility."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:458
msgid "How does Multisite work?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:458
msgid ""
"Network activation makes GlotFrame available to every website. Each website "
"keeps its own settings and layouts; there are no network-wide design "
"overrides."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:459
msgid "What happens when I deactivate or delete it?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:459
msgid ""
"Deactivation preserves everything. Deletion preserves settings and layouts "
"by default. Enable the deletion option only if you want to remove this "
"website’s GlotFrame content too. Other plugins and translation data are "
"retained."
msgstr ""

